# Project Orchestration Task Board

> Managed by `agent-orchestrator`. Tasks are created, worked, and closed by the Supervisor and Subagents.

## 🟢 Open Tickets
<!-- Tickets ready to be picked up by subagents -->

## 🟡 In Progress
<!-- Currently active tasks -->

## 🟣 Subagent Discoveries
<!-- Discovered blockers, bugs, or missing items flagged by subagents during execution -->

## 🏁 Closed Tickets
<!-- Completed and verified tasks with resolution summaries -->

---

### Ticket Format Reference

```markdown
- [ ] **#T-001: [Task Title]**
  - **Role**: `implementer` (Model: `flash`)
  - **Scope**: `src/modules/...`
  - **Objective**: Concise description of what needs to be done.
  - **Resolution** (filled upon close): Brief summary + commit hash.
```
